      "created_at": "2015-02-16T21:23:26.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If you can find a post made by Adam, he's the artist and the one you need permission from.</p><p>I've gotten permission from him before, as long as you aren't using his art to profit you without him getting a proper cut I doubt it would be a problem, if you are using the art to advertise the game or your game night where you play the game, I doubt there would be any issue.</p>",
